FFmpegGUI OS modern3 release validation
Date: 2026-08-12 JST

Release scope
-------------
The AI command protocol now uses the versioned FFMPEGGUI_COMMAND_V1 envelope
with literal FFmpeg double quotes. BYOK, paste, and clipboard input share one
parser. Strict legacy JSON, one command fence, and a plain command remain
compatible. Duplicate or malformed envelopes, damaged JSON, invalid SID
bindings, hidden Unicode format characters, and invalid surrogates fail closed.

